  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower into small florets. Cut carrot and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place carrot and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-0bf37c04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, place cauliflower on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over Aussie spice blend and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and brown around edges, 20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-a5f6ea57.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove tray with roasted cauliflower from oven and sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Return to oven, and bake until cheese is golden, 5-8 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-ab340250.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the cauliflower has 5 minutes remaining, cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks. Place on a third lined oven tray and bake until golden, 5 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray only has two racks, add the ciabatta pieces to the tray with the cauliflower.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-4df60fca.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add baby spinach leaves, croutons and balsamic vinaigrette dressing to the tray with the roasted veggies. Season and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-1831e984.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie toss between bowls.\n• Top with cheesy cauliflower. Drizzle over dill & parsley mayonnaise.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6462e5872031d3e226067c08/step-923708c2.jpg"
    }
  ]
